  "body": "1. The following piece of code \r\n\r\n```\r\n<svg id=\"rectangle\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1990/xlink\"  width=\"100\" height=\"100\">\r\n  <foreignObject width=\"100\" height=\"50\" requiredExtensions=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">\r\n    <body xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">\r\n      <iframe src='/apps/script.html'></iframe>\r\n    </body>\r\n  </foreignObject>\r\n</svg>\r\n\r\n```\r\nGets executed in Firefox, where as both Chrome and Safari render it as content (as reveled by the Response in the Network Tab in the screen shots below \r\n\r\n#### Firefox executing : svg -> foreignObject -> iframe #### \r\n<img width=\"994\" alt=\"Screen Shot 2019-11-12 at 7 52 10 PM\" src=\"https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/50095614/68731905-7d0d4680-0586-11ea-80cd-4a032a73cb3e.png\">\r\n\r\n#### Chrome  rendering svg -> foreignObject -> iframe, \r\n<img width=\"1050\" alt=\"Screen Shot 2019-11-12 at 7 51 44 PM\" src=\"https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/50095614/68732032-e4c39180-0586-11ea-965a-f05be930ebe3.png\">\r\n  as content  ####\r\n",
